Package: funresMech
Title: Mechanistic Functional Response Analysis with Shiny
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Segundo", "Núñez-Campero", 
           email = "segundo.nc@conicet.gov.ar", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the Okuyama (2012) mechanistic functional response model 
    with an interactive Shiny application. Provides functions for fitting 
    the model, generating likelihood profiles, and visualizing stochastic 
    curves and distributions.
